{"4130810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dave's Wrecking Yard 3D","steam_appid":4130810,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun little &quot;Free to Play&quot; automotive wrecking yard simulator in it's early stages. Find &amp; collect specific car parts to complete orders, box them up &amp; ship them across the country or sell them over the counter. Engine rebuilding has recently been added for hours of entertainment. Statistics are collected so you can see just how much work was done, how much money you've made as well as all the pizza &amp; soda you consumed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current list of activities available:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull parts from vehicles for online orders to box &amp; ship them out for delivery<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive parts requests from customers over the phone, box them up and wait for pickup<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recondition complete engines, test run them, and sell to customers over the phone<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recondition carburetors and cylinder heads to complete online orders for shipping<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull parts from vehicles to sell to walk-in customers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair vehicles of drive-in customers<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat Pizza, drink soda and or smoke up a cig<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun little &quot;Free to Play&quot; automotive wrecking yard simulator in it's early stages. Find &amp; collect specific car parts to complete orders, box them up &amp; ship them across the country or sell them over the counter. Engine rebuilding has recently been added for hours of entertainment. Statistics are collected so you can see just how much work was done, how much money you've made as well as all the 